                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='89625' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='9375'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Glossary - Variables in Metric Parameter:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>- </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Activity Rate:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'> measures the quantity of users corresponding to the Cohort group which were active during the period contained by the Activity Group.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>- </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Activation Rate:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'> measures the amount of newly activated users from the Cohort group during the period contained by the Activity Group.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>- </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Cumulative Activation Rate</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>: measures the percentage of the Cohort group population that has been activated up to the Activity Group date. So if we are looking at activity group rate, Cumulative Activation rate would be equal to the sum of the Activation rate for Activity Groups 0, 1 and 2.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>- </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>MAU:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'> Number of users in the Cohort group which were active during the period contained by the Activity Group. Used as numerator for Activity Rate.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>- </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>New Activations:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'> Number of users in the Cohort group which have become active for the first time in the period contained by the Activity Group. Used as numerator for Activation Rate.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>- </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Avg. Limit Granted/MAU:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'> Average limit for the active user base in the period contained in the Activity Group. Calculated by adding each active user&apos;s available limit and dividing by the quantity of active users in the activity Group. The limit assigned to each user is the limit the user had by the last day of the Grant Date Month + Activity Group number. E.g. users granted in November being analyzed in Activity Group 2 will be assigned the last available limit they had by January (November + 2 months).</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>- </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Utilised Limit/MAU:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'> Average disbured amount by active user during the period contained by the Activity Group.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>- </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Utilisation Rate:  </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>% of the Avg. Limit per active user being used (Utilised Limit per MAU / Avg. Limit granted per MAU).</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>- </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Platform Spend/MAU:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'> Average money spent by BNPL active users in the platform as a whole, during the period contained by the Activity Group.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>- </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>BNPL Share of Spend: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>% of the total money spent by BNPL active users that was disbursed through the BNPL product (Utilised Limit per MAU/ Platform Spend per MAU).</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>- </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Grants platform active:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'> Number of BNPL granted users that have been active in the platform (not necessarily through BNPL) in the period contained by the Activity Group.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>- </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Share of grants platform active:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'> % of the user grant base that has been active in the platform (not necessarily through BNPL) in the period contained by the Activity Group.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zones>
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
      <simple-id uuid='{92A8C36C-1F23-47D2-9565-9737D030E979}' />
    </dashboard>
  </dashboards>
